  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n18 ∶ 190 ∶∶ 20 ∶ 210 ∶∶ 22 ∶ ?\n\n**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no. × 10) + 10]\n\n**18 : 190 →**\n\n⇒ [(18 × 10) + 10]\n\n⇒ (180 + 10) = 190\n\n**20 : 210 →**\n\n⇒ [(20 × 10) + 10]\n\n⇒ (200 + 10) = 210\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**22 : ? →**\n\n⇒ [(22 × 10) + 10]\n\n⇒ (220 + 10) =** 230**\n\nHere, **'22 : 230' **is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".\n\nbd:T81c,\n<",
